                "# NorthGrid Energy Operations\n",
                "\n",
                "**Reliability story:** Work order backlog, maintenance spend, and sensor health for the NorthGrid synthetic energy fleet spanning 2024–2026. Open work orders dominate the backlog (majority never complete), maintenance cost is driven heavily by Operator Error root cause, and Flow/Pressure/Temperature sensors generate the most alerts. Use the filters page to slice by region or time window."
